# Code owners for the RFP Hub.
#
# This file is the authoritative list of editors of the standard (GOVERNANCE.md points here
# rather than naming people in prose, because a prose list goes stale and a CODEOWNERS entry
# cannot). Editors are added and removed by PR to this file.
#
# Ownership here means: a change to these paths needs an editor's review. It is not a claim of
# authorship — the standard is CC0.

# Default: the maintainer team reviews anything not matched below.
*                                       @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the standard --
# Normative artifacts. A change to any of these is a change to the data contract.
/packages/standard/schemas/**           @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/packages/standard/registries/**        @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/packages/standard/conformance/**       @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/packages/standard/meta/**              @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/packages/standard/spec.config.json     @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- governance --
# The rules themselves, and the record of how they were decided.
/packages/standard/PROCESS.md           @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/packages/standard/NORMATIVE.md         @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/packages/standard/CHANGELOG.md         @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md                          @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                        @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
/adr/**                                 @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------- CI ---
# The checks that enforce all of the above.
/.github/**                             @The-RFP-Hub/maintainers
